      "cluster_id": 0,
      "headline_hint": "US envoys meet Putin in Moscow as Russia orders 72-hour pause in Kyiv strikes",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 0,
      "claim_count": 20,
      "distinct_outlets": 5,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 19,
        "summary": 1
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner met Russian President Vladimir Putin in Moscow.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russian President Vladimir Putin told US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner during their meeting in Moscow that the current situation is not so easy.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Steve Witkoff thanked Vladimir Putin for agreeing with Ukraine to halt strikes on each other's capitals for three days.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner are scheduled to travel to Kyiv on Sunday for diplomatic engagements.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US President Donald Trump stated on Friday that Witkoff and Kushner were bringing a proposal to end the war.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Talks between Vladimir Putin and the US envoys at the Kremlin lasted for three hours, according to Russian state media.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky stated that Ukraine is ready to refrain from strikes on Moscow through the end of Saturday, as well as on Sunday and Monday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Vladimir Putin ordered a halt to strikes on Kyiv for three days due to the visit by US envoys.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Vladimir Putin stated in televised remarks that Russia had not agreed to a ceasefire for areas of Ukraine outside of Kyiv.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky said Russia fired demonstrative strikes on airports in Kyiv and Boryspil overnight prior to his planned meeting with US envoys.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky said an overnight Russian strike on a civilian building in the Dnipro region killed four people and injured five others.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "CIA Director John Ratcliffe paid a rare visit to the Russian capital a little over a week prior to Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner's visit.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cx2zqp46g8eo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "US envoys Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner met Russian President Vladimir Putin at the Kremlin on Saturday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/9/5/us-envoys-witkoff-kushner-meet-putin-for-talks-on-ukraine-war?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "summary"
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Kremlin spokesperson Dmitry Peskov stated that Vladimir Putin gave the order from midnight Saturday not to strike Kyiv for three days.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Russian strikes on Saturday killed at least seven people in Ukraine, including two in the Bucha district outside Kyiv.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Oleksandr Hanzha, head of the local military administration, stated that an overnight Russian strike at a factory in the Dnipropetrovsk region killed five people and wounded five others.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "A Russian drone hit the headquarters of Ukraine's Security Service (SBU) on Friday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Ground troops in Ukraine remain locked along a 775-mile frontline.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/steve-witkoff-jared-kushner-russia-revive-ukraine-talks",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Vladimir Putin stated at the start of the meeting in Moscow that it is convenient for Russia to work with Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/trump-sends-his-best-wishes-us-envoys-witkoff-kushner-meet-putin-in-kremlin/articleshow/133813118.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "cluster_id": 0,
          "text": "Steve Witkoff and Jared Kushner were received in Moscow by Kirill Dmitriev, Vladimir Putin's investment envoy.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/trumps-envoys-witkoff-and-kushner-meet-putin-in-moscow-as-us-makes-fresh-push-to-revive-ukraine-peace-talks-11788629564277.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 1,
      "headline_hint": "US military disables three Iranian oil tankers following attacks on American warships",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 1,
      "claim_count": 13,
      "distinct_outlets": 4,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 12,
        "summary": 1
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 21,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Central Command stated it permanently disabled two Iran-linked oil tankers and completely destroyed a third in the Gulf of Oman.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Central Command stated the strikes on Iranian tankers were in retaliation for Tehran targeting a US aircraft carrier and a guided-missile destroyer.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Kharg Island hosts Iran's main oil export terminal, handling approximately 90% of the country's crude oil exports via pipes from the mainland.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "Iranian state media Irib reported that Iran's Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps retaliated against six ships, including three oil tankers in the Strait of Hormuz and three US-affiliated vessels.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Defence Secretary Pete Hegseth posted on social media that if Iran shoots at US ships, the US will destroy and sink their oil tankers.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "The US resumed attacks against Iran after striking two rocket launchers to prevent them from laying naval mines in the Strait of Hormuz.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "The average price for a gallon of diesel in the US reached $5.85, up from $3.71 a year prior.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Vice President JD Vance stated he was extremely sceptical regarding Iranian claims that US strikes killed four people at a wedding in Sirik, Iran.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cj64rrne643o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Central Command reported that its forces struck three Iranian crude oil carriers on Saturday.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/9/5/us-says-it-hit-three-iranian-oil-tankers-after-attacks-on-warships?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "summary"
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Central Command commander Admiral Brad Cooper stated that the US military would destroy Iran's oil fleet if necessary to defend American forces.",
          "kind": "quote",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/us-military-iran-tankers",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "A preliminary US military inquiry found that a February 28 strike on a school compound in Minab that killed at least 156 people resulted from outdated coordinates identifying the school as part of a naval base.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/us-military-iran-tankers",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Central Command identified the permanently disabled tankers as M/T Downy, struck off Kharg Island, and M/T Stark 1, struck near Jask.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/watch-us-strikes-3-iranian-oil-tankers-after-iran-targets-2-navy-warships/articleshow/133805095.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "cluster_id": 1,
          "text": "US Central Command identified the destroyed third tanker as M/T Kylo, also known as Noxen, which was struck in the Gulf of Oman.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/defence/international/watch-us-strikes-3-iranian-oil-tankers-after-iran-targets-2-navy-warships/articleshow/133805095.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 2,
      "headline_hint": "Rescuers pull survivors from wreckage 10 days after catastrophic Nepal-China floods",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 2,
      "claim_count": 12,
      "distinct_outlets": 5,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 12
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 34,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Chandika Kumari Shrestha, 64, was rescued semi-conscious from the upper floor of a four-storey house buried in debris in Betrawati, Nuwakot district, 10 days after floods hit Nepal.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/10-days-after-nepal-flash-floods-woman-chinese-man-rescued/articleshow/133815989.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Chinese worker Luhaitao was rescued alive from 225 metres inside the Audit 4 tunnel of the Upper Trishuli-1 hydropower project in Rasuwa.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/10-days-after-nepal-flash-floods-woman-chinese-man-rescued/articleshow/133815989.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Luhaitao was rescued by a joint team of Nepal army personnel and South Korean experts and flown to Birendra Military Hospital.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/10-days-after-nepal-flash-floods-woman-chinese-man-rescued/articleshow/133815989.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Local officials in Betrawati stated that only five of around 300 houses remained standing after the flood.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Times of India",
          "url": "https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/south-asia/10-days-after-nepal-flash-floods-woman-chinese-man-rescued/articleshow/133815989.cms",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "More than 1,300 people were killed after a collapse of ice, rock, and mud swept through a Himalayan valley in Nepal.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260905-chinese-national-rescued-from-nepal-tunnel-10-days-after-flash-flood",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Nepal's national disaster authority reported that the flood disaster killed at least 1,331 people in Nepal and left about 5,000 missing, including 589 foreign nationals.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/5/rescuers-pull-chinese-worker-nepali-woman-from-flood-wreckage-alive?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Officials in Tibet recorded 31 deaths and 531 people missing following the disaster across the border.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/5/rescuers-pull-chinese-worker-nepali-woman-from-flood-wreckage-alive?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "About 900 workers remain unaccounted for at hydropower construction sites in Nepal, with roughly 500 believed trapped inside tunnels across 12 projects.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Al Jazeera",
          "url": "https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/9/5/rescuers-pull-chinese-worker-nepali-woman-from-flood-wreckage-alive?traffic_source=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Nearly 100% of Nepal's electricity comes from hydropower, earning nearly $200m annually from exports to India and Bangladesh.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy0zx368prno?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The floods severely damaged 12 hydropower plants in the Trishuli River basin and knocked out more than 10% of Nepal's total power generation capacity.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy0zx368prno?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "The Upper Trishuli-1 project is valued at about $647m and represents one of Nepal's largest foreign direct investment ventures.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cy0zx368prno?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "cluster_id": 2,
          "text": "Nepal's disaster management agency reported that at least 1,375 people have been killed in the floods, with more than 5,000 missing.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Guardian World",
          "url": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/sep/05/rescuers-nepal-find-two-more-people-alive-flood-disaster",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 3,
      "headline_hint": "UN adopts resolution approving new world map reflecting Africa's true size",
      "section": "world",
      "batch_position": 3,
      "claim_count": 12,
      "distinct_outlets": 5,
      "source_kinds": {
        "fulltext": 12
      },
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": 46,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The United Nations voted on Friday to support a shift away from the 16th-century Mercator global map toward one reflecting countries' true sizes.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "France 24",
          "url": "https://www.france24.com/en/video/20260905-un-approves-resolution-in-support-of-map-that-shows-africa-s-true-size",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The UN General Assembly adopted the Correct the Map resolution to address discrepancies in the Mercator map projection.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cly5r60v4mro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The African continent is approximately 14 times larger than Greenland in reality, despite appearing similar in size on the Mercator map.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cly5r60v4mro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "Flemish cartographer Gerardus Mercator created the Mercator map in 1569 to aid European sailors in ocean navigation.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cly5r60v4mro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The Equal Earth map projection was developed by a team of cartographers in 2018 and was adopted by African Union members in February.",
          "kind": "background",
          "outlet": "BBC World",
          "url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cly5r60v4mro?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "The African-led UN resolution championing equal-area map projections was adopted with 164 countries voting in favour, one voting against, and six abstaining.",
          "kind": "figure",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/europe-shrinks-africa-grows-the-un-vote-that-could-change-the-world-map-you-know-11788613080376.html",
          "source_kind": "fulltext"
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "cluster_id": 3,
          "text": "India voted in favour of the UN map resolution, while the United States was the only country to vote against it.",
          "kind": "event",
          "outlet": "Livemint",
          "url": "https://www.livemint.com/news/world/europe-shrinks-africa-grows-the-un-vote-that-could-change-the-world-map-you-know-11788613080376.html",
